<title>USA: Fair, Isaac names Patricia Cole CFO.</title>
<headline>Fair, Isaac names Patricia Cole CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN RAFAEL, Calif. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fair, Isaac and Co Inc said Patricia Cole was named senior vice president and chief financial officer. She replaces Gerald De Kerchove, who is remaining with the company as an executive vice president.</p>
<p>Cole joined the company in 1995 as vice president and controller, and has more than 25 years of experience in business finance.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available to say who Cole was replacing as chief financial officer.</p>
</text>
